'''CM-09 Bonesnapper''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page four of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 4|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|15|notext}} and 12 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

